# The repo-root .gitignore ignores tests/visual/__snapshots__/ and
# tests/visual/__reports__/. Baselines (__snapshots__) MUST be committed — they
# are the source of truth for visual diffing — so re-include them here (a child
# .gitignore overrides the parent). Per-run reports stay ignored.
!__snapshots__/
__reports__/
test-results/
